isinstance must agree with `is None` on typed slots carrying the
None marker: a constant TRUE admitted a value that is both None
and str (the laurel-encoding-experiments K diagnostic: FAILURE on
the tautology `not (e is None and isinstance(e, str))`). Nondet
strings and nondet list-of-str globals carry the data != NULL
representation invariant ({0, NULL} is reserved as the marker).
